think Oriented from KYRI, RADIANT_STYLE, REMEMBER, the top session-log rows, and the newest recommend line: the running thread is Season G open-media, exact-arithmetic image primitives in Rye, each GREEN on metal. The last lap landed image/min_enclosing_circle.rye (Welzl, the FACE-FIRST round bound); the card and the newest log named the crux-first next sibling: a MINIMUM-WIDTH slot (the EDGE-FIRST companion) or the LARGEST INSCRIBED disk (the inner mirror).
